  <item>
    <title>【懒得推理EP004】我们与推理结缘的二三事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c612320bef6c2074cac9da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c612320bef6c2074cac9da</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Feb 2024 11:53:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>岁末年初</span></strong><span>，由</span><strong><span>《懒得推理》</span></strong><span>推出的第四期节目</span><strong><span>「偷懒读书社 · 我们与推理结缘的二三事」</span></strong><span>来啦～ 在此</span><strong><span>祝大家龙年大吉、阖家幸福，新年快乐</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为今年的最后一期节目，我们想</span><strong><span>和大家聊聊初入推理坑的那些事儿</span></strong><span>。你将会在本期节目中听到一个又一个熟悉的名字：</span><strong><span>《冒险小虎队》、《福尔摩斯探案》、《放学后》，《推理世界》… </span></strong><span>让我们一起乘上时光机，找回那段有关推理的美好回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>照例感谢每位听友的支持，你们的关注、点赞与想法对我们来说十分重要。我们也期待着，能在评论区看到你与推理结缘的故事，和你分享这一段感动和快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>新的一年，一起读更多精彩好玩的推理小说！😉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>阿豺</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦麦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾（按字母顺序排名）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>好好</span></p><span></span><p><span>凯文</span></p><span></span><p><span>绿豹（显形嘉宾）</span></p><span></span><p><span>前进四</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>特别鸣谢</span></strong><span>（按字母顺序排名）</span></p><span></span><p><span>蓝桥 ｜ 音频后期+美工</span></p><span></span><p><span>乔鲁诺乔巴纳 ｜ 音频审核</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a> 初遇推理：《冒险小虎队》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 初遇推理：《福尔摩斯探案》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> 初遇推理：《名侦探柯南》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1319">21:59</a> 初遇推理：东野圭吾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">30:43</a> 初遇推理：推理杂志</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1876">31:16</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 初遇推理：推理影视作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2695">44:55</a> 入坑推理：阿婆 &amp; 岛田庄司 &amp; 010</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">45:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3449">57:29</a> 入坑推理：《人狼城》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3464">57:44</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">01:10:00</a> 入坑推理：今村昌弘 &amp; 青崎有吾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4205">01:10:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4427">01:13:47</a> 从阅读到创作推理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4431">01:13:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5789">01:36:29</a> 如何向萌新安利推理小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5794">01:36:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5932">01:38:52</a> 入坑小贴士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5949">01:39:09</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6589">01:49:49</a> 读啥要趁早 / 晚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6601">01:50:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6772">01:52:52</a> 结尾 &amp; 新年祝福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6775">01:52:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6912">01:55:12</a> 正片开始（必听！）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj0rue62_o8dAPmBmaa_3G2InHan.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
