    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Feb 2024 02:08:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新老听友们大家好呀，由</span><strong><span>《懒得推理》</span></strong><span>推出的第三期节目</span><strong><span>「偷懒读书社 · 2024年共读圆桌会第1期」</span></strong><span>来咯！偷偷告诉大家：这还是一个会长期录制的新专（大）题（坑）哦～</span></p><p><span>你问</span><strong><span>群共读</span></strong><span>是什么东东？</span><strong><span>2024</span></strong><span>年群友最</span><strong><span>想读的一本书有那些</span></strong><span>？有没有</span><strong><span>那本推理小说能让人一口气读完</span></strong><span>？那些</span><strong><span>恐怖度</span></strong><span>拉满的推理小说又有些什么？</span><strong><span>快快收听，我们来一一告诉你!!!</span></strong></p><p><span>欢迎</span><strong><span>热爱推理的你</span></strong><span>也加入组织，和我们一起</span><strong><span>读书唠嗑</span></strong><span>（或吐槽）～</span></p><p><span>另外照例感谢每位听友的支持，你们的</span><strong><span>关注、点赞</span></strong><span>与想法对我们来说实在十分重要❤ 因此如</span><strong><span>有任何反馈</span></strong><span>，请务必要动动小手</span><strong><span>留言告诉我们哦</span></strong><span>（深深鞠躬）。祝大家都有被好书包围的美好一周😊</span></p><p><strong><span>节目主播</span></strong></p><p><span>乔鲁诺乔巴纳</span></p><p><span>麦麦</span></p><p><strong><span>嘉宾</span></strong><span>（按字母顺序排名）</span></p><p><span>阿豺</span></p><p><span>好好</span></p><p><span>绿豹（持续隐形嘉宾）</span></p><p><span>南辞</span></p><p><span>無佬</span></p><p><span>小顾</span></p><p><strong><span>特别鸣谢</span></strong><span>（按字母顺序排名）</span></p><p><span>阿豺 ｜ 美工</span></p><p><span>高大宝 ｜ 音频后期</span></p><p><span>蓝桥 ｜ 音频后期</span></p><p><span>乔鲁诺乔巴纳 ｜ 音频审核</span></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 开头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 群共读介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3071">51:11</a> 今年最想读的推理小说：《夏与冬的奏鸣曲》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3082">51:22</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 那些让人一口气读完的推理小说：《19年间谋杀小叙》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1669">27:49</a> 恐怖度拉满的推理小说：《黑暗之家》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a> 结尾</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgOBiY3mxrffSbFvzsBbh0KvDN9y.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
