    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>承蒙听友们的厚（催）爱（更）</span><strong><span>，由《懒得推理》推出的第二期节目「懒得推理读书社 · 2023年年度TOP 10榜单分享（下）」也终于来啦！</span></strong><span>（当然，如果你还没听过上一期，你知道要怎么做的😉）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>感恩这段时间以来每一位听友的关注、点赞和建议，我们全都收到咯！</span></strong><span>接下来我们将带着大家的反馈和支持前进，继续做出更多精彩节目。这一路还请小伙伴们多多包涵❤&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小编提示</span></strong><span>：本期节目含主播精心加入的福利【一刀未剪彩蛋】，请务必要听到最后哦！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>乔鲁诺乔巴纳</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦麦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>特邀嘉宾（按字母顺序排名）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>阿豺</span></p><span></span><p><span>晨曦</span></p><span></span><p><span>好好</span></p><span></span><p><span>凯文</span></p><span></span><p><span>绿豹（持续隐形嘉宾）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>特别鸣谢（按字母顺序排名）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>阿豺 ｜ 美工</span></p><span></span><p><span>aki ｜ 专业顾问</span></p><span></span><p><span>艾罗西 ｜ 美工</span></p><span></span><p><span>乔鲁诺乔巴纳 ｜ 音频剪辑 + 声音设计</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 开头与致谢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 设定系推理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 方丈贵惠《献给名侦探的甜美死亡》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 方丈贵惠《孤岛的来访者》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">20:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2162">36:02</a> 加贺美雅之《双月城的惨剧》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2162">36:02</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3556">59:16</a> 白井智之《象之首》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3594">59:54</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4462">1:14:22</a> 白井智之《名侦探的献祭》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4464">1:14:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4659">1:17:39</a> 新年祝福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4659">01:17:39</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5374">01:29:34</a> 正片开始（bushi）</span></p><span></span><p><span>如有想听的节目主题，请三连并留言告诉我们～ 谢谢大家（鞠躬）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FikmIsH0E1PJpyUWT_pMqAUjEh8l.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
