    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>各位听众朋友们，龙年快乐呀！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这是由《懒得推理》推出的第一期节目「懒得推理读书社 · 2023年年度TOP 10榜单分享（上）」，很高兴能在新年伊始和大家见面。</span></p><span></span><p><span>该榜单由近1000名推理读书社的群员匿名投票选出，汇总了大家在去年读过的、认为最值得推荐的10本小说。也期待更多小伙伴能在评论区告诉我们，你心目中的最精彩的年度TOP 10都有哪些好书～</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>节目主播</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>乔鲁诺乔巴纳</span></p><span></span><p><span>麦麦</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>特邀嘉宾（按字母顺序排名）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>阿豺</span></p><span></span><p><span>晨曦</span></p><span></span><p><span>好好</span></p><span></span><p><span>凯文</span></p><span></span><p><span>绿豹（隐形嘉宾）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>美工、音频剪辑及特别鸣谢（按字母顺序排名）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>阿豺</span></p><span></span><p><span>aki</span></p><span></span><p><span>艾罗西</span></p><span></span><p><span>乔鲁诺乔巴纳</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> 推理读书社介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 陈浩基《1367》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 白井智之《无人逝去》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">30:17</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2522">42:02</a> 三津田信三《如首无作祟之物》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2525">42:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3198">53:18</a> 浅仓秋成《六个说谎的大学生》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3251">54:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4045">01:07:25</a> 贵志佑介《玻璃之锤》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4062">01:07:42</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4076">01:07:56</a> 结尾</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>最后，衷心感谢推理读书社的各位一年来的支持和陪伴，新的一年愿大家都能读到更好的作品、</span><strong><span>身体健康，万事顺意！</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>PS: 别忘了为我们订阅 + 分享 + 评论哦，你的喜爱和建议，真的很重要。❤️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhRKtQ0aF8P8z2A4QvYVHfvuy-sp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljH4l89m9rwI2d-GUFLvU_zNbSBb.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
